Neural Scheduler

This repository contains code derived from the following projects.

GLM-4-Voice (https://github.com/THUDM/GLM-4-Voice), Apache License 2.0.
  neural_scheduler/model/modeling.py and configuration.py are modified
  versions of the GLM-4-Voice ChatGLM model and configuration.

NTPP (https://github.com/Chaos96/NTPP), Apache License 2.0.
  The dual-channel formulation and the channel-embedding approach follow
  NTPP; this project started as a fork of that repository.

Full-Duplex-Bench (https://github.com/DanielLin94144/Full-Duplex-Bench),
CC BY-NC 4.0.
  neural_scheduler/evaluation/fdb/eval_backchannel.py re-implements the
  benchmark's backchannel metric computation for this project's output
  layout. The benchmark code and data are not included.

Models and datasets used by this code (GLM-4-Voice weights, Seamless
Interaction, Fisher English, RoBERTa, HuBERT, Qwen3-Omni, Chatterbox,
Silero VAD) are distributed by their owners under their own terms and are
not included.
